Table full name: MITELMAN.PROD.KARYABNORM
Column name: CaseNo Type: TEXT Description: case number, most frequently an integer between 1 and 10, but can also be an arbitrary string, eg '11H046'
Column name: InvNo Type: NUMBER Description: investigation number (between 1 and 9)
Column name: CloneNo Type: NUMBER Description: clone number (between 1 and 58)
Column name: OrderNo Type: NUMBER Description: order number (between 1 and 198)
Column name: RefNo Type: NUMBER Description: reference number, eg '14620'
Column name: Abnormality Type: TEXT Description: eg '46', or 'XY', or 'XX', or '-22', etc
Sample rows:
[{'RefNo': 401, 'CaseNo': '109', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Abnormality': '??'}, {'RefNo': 737, 'CaseNo': '105', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Abnormality': '??'}, {'RefNo': 737, 'CaseNo': '63', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Abnormality': '??'}, {'RefNo': 737, 'CaseNo': '67', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Abnormality': '??'}, {'RefNo': 737, 'CaseNo': '82', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Abnormality': '??'}]

