Table full name: MITELMAN.PROD.CYTOGENINVVALID
Column name: CaseNo Type: TEXT Description: case number -- usually an intger, but can also be an arbitrary string
Column name: Reason Type: TEXT Description: Error Messages
Column name: InvNo Type: NUMBER Description: investigation number -- always an integer between 1 and 9
Column name: KaryLong Type: TEXT Description: if the karyotype description exceeds a certain length, the full string is in this column, otherwise this field is null
