RefNo,CaseNo,InvNo,CloneNo,CloneShort,Chr13_Ord,Chr13_Start,Chr13_End,Chr17_Ord,Chr17_Start,Chr17_End,Chr11_Ord,Chr11_Start,Chr11_End
